{"index":0,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1027.96,"top":43.23,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚\n2451503\nsaioog@tongji\n2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997.71,"top":584.95,"width":227.2,"height":63.36}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":841.45,"top":280,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"shape","position":{"left":64,"top":196,"width":720,"height":32.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"ROS 2 工作空间与编译","position":{"left":64,"top":244,"width":720,"height":59}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"包的创建、编译与三类典型报错\n三条技术路线概览与技术栈评估","position":{"left":64,"top":360.46,"width":720,"height":72}}]}
{"index":1,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1027.96,"top":43.23,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚\n2451503\nsaioog@tongji\n2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997.71,"top":584.95,"width":227.2,"height":63.36}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":841.45,"top":280,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"shape","position":{"left":64,"top":196,"width":720,"height":32.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"目录\n一、工作空间与包的创建\n二、编译与三类典型报错\n三、技术路线概览\n四、技术栈与难度评估","position":{"left":91.35,"top":97.2,"width":649.29,"height":444.8}}]}
{"index":2,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间的四个目录","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"目录\t装什么\t能不能删\nsrc/\t包的源代码，唯一需要手工编辑的地方\t不能，删了就没了\nbuild/\t编译中间产物，CMake 缓存和目标文件\t能，会自动重建\ninstall/\t可执行文件、launch、config，以及每个包的 package.xml 副本\t能，会自动重建\nlog/\t每次编译的日志\t能，建议按需清理","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":170}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":3,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"包与 package.xml","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":38.5}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"package.xml 是包的身份证。colcon 从当前目录往下递归查找 package.xml，找到哪个目录，哪个目录就是一个包。","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"包必须放在 src/ 下面。","position":{"left":48,"top":213.3,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":4,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"创建包的两种类型","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"cd /userdata/dev_ws\nsource /opt/tros/humble/setup.bash\n\nros2 pkg create --build-type ament_cmake my_cpp_pkg \\\n  --dependencies rclcpp geometry_msgs\n\nros2 pkg create --build-type ament_python my_py_pkg \\\n  --dependencies rclpy","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":184.8}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"命名：全小写加下划线，例如 demo1_visual_control。","position":{"left":48,"top":344.8,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":5,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"两种包的最小结构","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"C++ 包，ament_cmake","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":381,"height":24.8}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"my_cpp_pkg/\n  package.xml\n  CMakeLists.txt\n  src/xxx.cpp\n  include/my_cpp_pkg/xxx.hpp\n  launch/xxx.launch.py\n  config/xxx.yaml","position":{"left":48,"top":178.8,"width":381,"height":141.02}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"Python 包，ament_python","position":{"left":451,"top":144,"width":381,"height":24.8}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"my_py_pkg/\n  package.xml\n  setup.py\n  setup.cfg\n  resource/my_py_pkg\n  my_py_pkg/xxx.py\n  launch/xxx.launch.py","position":{"left":451,"top":178.8,"width":381,"height":141.02}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"CMakeLists.txt 里写 find_package、add_executable、install。","position":{"left":48,"top":335.82,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":6,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"依赖声明与三类报错","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"阶段\t典型报错\t缺的是什么\n编译\tfatal error: geometry_msgs/msg/twist.hpp: No such file or directory\t<depend> 没写，或 CMake 里没 find_package\n链接\tundefined reference to ...\t库找到了但没链接，检查 ament_target_dependencies\n运行\tPackage 'x' not found\t<exec_depend> 没写，或忘了 source install","position":{"left":48,"top":188.65,"width":784,"height":136}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":7,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"三个 demo 包的放置","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":38.5}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"cd /userdata/dev_ws\ncp -a <training>/demos/demo1_visual_ws/src/demo1_visual_control src/\ncp -a <training>/demos/demo2_nav2_teb_ws/src/demo2_nav2_teb src/\ncp -a <training>/demos/demo3_lio_ws/src/demo3_lio src/","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":106.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"只复制包目录，不要复制外层的 build、install、log。","position":{"left":48,"top":266.4,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":8,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"编译的唯一正确位置","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"编译只在包含 src/ 的那一层执行。","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":28.65}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"pwd        # 期望输出 /userdata/dev_ws\nls src     # 期望看到 demo1_visual_control 等包名","position":{"left":48,"top":188.65,"width":784,"height":67.2}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":9,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"编译的四条命令","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"cd /userdata/dev_ws                         # 1 进工作空间根\nsource /opt/tros/humble/setup.bash          # 2 系统环境\ncolcon build --symlink-install \\\n  --packages-select demo1_visual_control    # 3 编译\nsource install/setup.bash                   # 4 认识新编译的包","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":126}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"source install/setup.bash 每开一个新终端都要做。","position":{"left":48,"top":355.3,"width":784,"height":24.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":10,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"两个常用参数","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"参数\t作用\t常见误解\n--packages-select 包名\t只编译指定包，跳过无关包，省时间\t它不会自动编译依赖，依赖缺了仍然报错\n--symlink-install\tPython 代码、launch、config 用软链接安装\tC++ 代码改完仍然必须重新编译","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":132}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":11,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"系统时间：症状与关键词","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":38.5}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"date 输出 2000 年，就是系统时间的问题。","position":{"left":48,"top":213.3,"width":784,"height":28.65}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"make: warning: Clock skew detected. Your build may be incomplete.\nmake: Warning: File 'xxx.o' has modification time 8.2e+08 s in the future\nE: Release file for http://... is not valid yet (invalid for another 9d 3h)\nCertificate verification failed: The certificate is NOT yet valid\ncertificate is not yet valid","position":{"left":48,"top":257.95,"width":784,"height":119}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":12,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"系统时间错：修复步骤","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":38.5}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"date                        # 先看时间\nsudo timedatectl set-ntp true\nsudo timedatectl status      # System clock synchronized: yes\ndate                        # 确认年份已经是今年","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":106.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"sudo date -s \"2026-10-13 19:30:00\"","position":{"left":48,"top":311.05,"width":784,"height":47.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":13,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"编译错位置：成因","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"在 src/ 里编译会生成 src/build 和 src/install，install 里的 package.xml 会被当成第二个同名包。","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"Duplicate package names not supported\nCMake Error: The current CMakeCache.txt directory /a/build/x is different\n  than the directory /b/build/x where CMakeCache.txt was created","position":{"left":48,"top":282.6,"width":784,"height":82.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":14,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"编译错位置：产物清理","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":38.5}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"删之前确认自己在工作空间根，要删的对象只有 build、install、log。","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":28.65}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"cd /userdata/dev_ws\npwd\nfind src -maxdepth 3 -type d \\\n  \\( -name build -o -name install -o -name log \\)\nrm -rf src/build src/install src/log\nrm -rf build install log\ncolcon build --symlink-install --packages-select <包名>\nsource install/setup.bash","position":{"left":48,"top":188.65,"width":784,"height":173.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"临时绕开：在目录里放一个空的 COLCON_IGNORE。","position":{"left":48,"top":447.55,"width":784,"height":44.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":15,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"忘记 source install","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":33.9}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"$ ros2 launch demo1_visual_control demo1.launch.py\nPackage 'demo1_visual_control' not found","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":67.2}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"source /userdata/dev_ws/install/setup.bash\nros2 pkg list | grep demo","position":{"left":48,"top":271.85,"width":784,"height":67.2}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":16,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"报错速查表","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"报错里的关键词\t说明\t处理\nClock skew detected\t系统时间不对\t先 date，再 timedatectl set-ntp true\nin the future\t文件时间戳在未来\t同上，然后删产物重编\nis not valid yet 或 NOT yet valid\t证书尚未生效，时钟太早\t同上\nDuplicate package names not supported\t同一包名被扫描到两次\t删掉 src/ 里的 build、install、log\nCMakeCache.txt is different\tbuild 目录来自另一个路径\t删 build/ 重编\nPackage 'x' not found\t当前终端没 source install\tsource install/setup.bash\nNo such file or directory 指头文件\t依赖没声明\t补 <depend> 和 find_package\nundefined reference\t没链接库\t补 ament_target_dependencies","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":360}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":17,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"三条路线共用一套硬件","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":38.5}},{"kind":"table","text":"输入\t中间环节\t结果\n底盘轮速与 IMU\tEKF 融合，发布 odom 到 base_footprint 的 TF\t/odom、/odom_combined\nN10 雷达\tlslidar_driver\t/scan\nUSB 相机与推理节点\tYOLO 检测\t/win_detection","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":136}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":18,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"三条路线对比","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"路线\t位置来源\t障碍来源\t谁发控制量\t车端对应实现\ndemo1 视觉巡线\t图像里检测框的横坐标\tYOLO 检测框\t视觉控制器\torigincar_control\ndemo2 Nav2 加 TEB\t录制路径、TF 与定位\t雷达局部代价地图\tTEB 控制器插件\tmy_robot_nav 加 dzsavepath\ndemo3 二维 LIO\t自己算的二维位姿\t雷达点与车体包络\t纯追踪控制器\tlio_hybird","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":240}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":19,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"demo1 数据流","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"环节\t输入\t要做的事\n解析\t/win_detection 的 targets 与 rois\t按 type 分出 line 和 hat，处理空数组、低置信度与越界框\n决策\t线路框横坐标与障碍物框高度\t算横向误差，判断是否需要绕行，锁定绕行方向\n输出\t误差与状态\t限幅后发布 /cmd_vel，丢线时进入保持与搜索","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":224}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"要写五处：best_detection、make_command、障碍物分支、lost_line_command、reset_pid 的调用点。","position":{"left":48,"top":384,"width":784,"height":24.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":20,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"demo2 数据流","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"环节\t输入\t要做的事\n路径\t录制好的 CSV，坐标系是 map\t解析点位，处理行尾逗号与倒车标记\n目标\tnav_msgs/Path\t发给 /follow_path，指定 controller_id 为 TEB\n执行\tcontroller_server 与 local_costmap\tTEB 跟踪路径，障碍物挡路时局部绕行","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":224}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"要补三样：真实地图、nav2_full_params.yaml 的全部参数（含 controller_server.TEB 的 80 个参数）、FollowPath 客户端的发送与恢复逻辑。","position":{"left":48,"top":384,"width":784,"height":44.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":21,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"demo3 数据流","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"环节\t输入\t要做的事\n去畸变\t/scan 与 IMU 缓存\t按每束的时间戳插值姿态，把点补偿到同一时刻\n过滤与外参\t雷达量程与实测外参\t丢掉越界点和孤立点，把点变换到车体坐标系\n配准\t预测位姿与子地图\tICP 或 NDT 求修正量，用门限拒绝错误匹配\n控制\t/demo3_lio/odom 与路径\t选前视点，限曲率，近距离障碍停车","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":280}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"验收最硬：静止 60 s 位姿不发散，直线 5 m 往返有误差统计，原地转动时墙体不明显旋转，插入坏点后不崩溃。","position":{"left":48,"top":440,"width":784,"height":24.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":22,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"三条路线的公共约束","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"ros2 topic info /cmd_vel -v     # 正常情况下只有一个发布者","position":{"left":48,"top":188.65,"width":784,"height":47.6}},{"kind":"table","text":"约束\t说清楚的问题\t踩错的现象\n控制权唯一\t只有一条路线的节点在发 /cmd_vel\t车按另一套逻辑走\nTF 归属\todom 到 base_footprint 由 EKF 发布，别人不能重复发\tTF 出现两个父节点，Nav2 查询失败\n时间源一致\t回放带 /clock 的录包时全部节点加 use_sim_time\tTF 报 extrapolation，路径与雷达错位\nframe 名字\tIMU 的 frame 是 gyro_link\ttf2 查询报 frame 不存在","position":{"left":48,"top":252.25,"width":784,"height":220}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":23,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"技术栈对照","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"路线\t语言\tROS 2 知识点\t领域知识\t外部依赖\ndemo1\tC++\t话题、QoS、参数、定时器\t像素到控制量的映射、比例控制与 PID、状态机\t相机与 YOLO 推理节点\ndemo2\tPython 与 YAML\taction、lifecycle、TF、参数层级、插件加载\t代价地图、路径跟踪、优化器调参\tNav2 全套、TEB 插件、真实地图\ndemo3\tC++\t话题、QoS、TF、时间戳与时间同步\t平面状态估计、去畸变、ICP 与 NDT、观测拒绝\t雷达、IMU、轮速里程计、Eigen","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":304}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":24,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"难度评估","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"维度\tdemo1 视觉巡线\tdemo2 Nav2 加 TEB\tdemo3 二维 LIO\n自己要写的代码量\t约 200 至 350 行 C++\t约 100 至 250 行 Python，其余是配置\t约 500 至 1000 行 C++\n算法深度\t低，比例控制加状态机\t低，读框架不写算法\t高，去畸变、ICP、NDT、协方差\n主要难点\t符号约定与实车调参\t插件版本、TF 归属、参数类型\t时间同步与观测拒绝\n依赖可控性\t高，有录包可以离线练\t低，插件、地图、参数都要对齐\t中，需要真实传感器数据\n验收客观性\t中，靠现象观察\t中，靠现象观察\t高，有硬指标","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":264}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":25,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"三条路线各自的难点","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"demo1：算法浅，难在实车调参。","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"demo2：代码少，集成量大，报错不指向原因。","position":{"left":48,"top":213.3,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"demo3：算法最重，验收可以离线复现。","position":{"left":48,"top":282.6,"width":784,"height":53.3}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":26,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"评估依据","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"table","text":"\t车端实现\t教学骨架\t差额在哪\ndemo1\torigincar_control 966 行\t约 150 行外壳加占位\t四类目标解析、绕行方向推断、回线特判、二维码接管\ndemo2\t参数文件 412 行，加 dzfollowpath\t路径发布约 120 行\t地图、参数取值、行为树、FollowPath 完整逻辑\ndemo3\tLIO 节点 64 KB，纯追踪节点 208 KB\t两个节点合计约 10 KB\t去畸变、ICP、NDT、观测拒绝、协方差、keepout","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":224}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
{"index":27,"title":"工作空间与编译","elements":[{"kind":"textbox","text":"工作空间与编译","position":{"left":1023.73,"top":41.74,"width":252.04,"height":470.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"第二次培训","position":{"left":867.1,"top":45.35,"width":312.53,"height":80}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"开工前自查","position":{"left":48,"top":34,"width":784,"height":43.1}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"date                                       # 1 时间对不对，先看这一条\nsource /opt/tros/humble/setup.bash         # 2 系统环境\nsource /userdata/dev_ws/install/setup.bash # 3 工作空间环境，路径按实际改\nros2 pkg list | grep demo                  # 4 三个包在不在","position":{"left":48,"top":144,"width":784,"height":106.4}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"ros2 topic info /cmd_vel -v                # 发布者只能有一个","position":{"left":48,"top":311.05,"width":784,"height":47.6}},{"kind":"textbox","text":"孙智诚 2451503\nsaioog@tongji 2026 年 10 月 13 日","position":{"left":997,"top":588,"width":230,"height":62}}]}
